    "The trajectory model centers only CFO. It never selects, bends, deletes, or refits the fixed 3333/3334-sample integer frame teeth.",
    "Each frame has an independent complex scalar phase/amplitude nuisance; no phase continuity is claimed across frames or Pluto refills.",
    "The rolled-17 control independently selects over the same delay/CFO volume before held-out scoring.",
    "The primary direct-time score searches a full two-dimensional delay/CFO surface on training blocks only; padded windowed-sinc replicas are primary and the discontinuous analytic replica is a stability check.",
